      "message": "are they filtered out before they are passed in to WNS?\n\nOne of the nice things about what roshan pointed out was that we do not depend on WNS setting the bssid to any...  this means we can handle candidates from other selectors.  Would this be true for those selectors as well? If the list is filtered before they get it, then as long as that is tested to catch regressions, then that is great.  otherwise you might want a check here.  does that make sense?",
